<p>Send us photos of the room, or let us walk it, and tell us whether you want it refreshed or replaced. You get a flat quote by scope before anything starts, so there is no surprise invoice when the subfloor turns out to be soft. We handle the paint, the floor, the fixtures, the tile, and the <a href="/services/plumbing/">plumbing</a> with one schedule and one point of contact, and every job closes with photos.</p>
